### BigBite API walkthrough (VS Code "REST Client" or IntelliJ HTTP Client)
### Start the backend first. Requests run top to bottom; each one stores what the next needs.
### Demo accounts come from the demo seeder (see backend/.env.example).

@base = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Public branch directory (no login)
GET {{base}}/api/branches

### 2. Public menu of branch 1, available items only
# @name menu
GET {{base}}/api/menu/branch/1?availableOnly=true

### 3. Sign in as each role
# @name customer
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "customer@bigbite.lk", "password": "Customer@123"}

###
# @name staff
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "staff.cmb03@bigbite.lk", "password": "Staff@123"}

###
# @name rider
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "rider.cmb03@bigbite.lk", "password": "Rider@123"}

###
# @name manager
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "manager.cmb03@bigbite.lk", "password": "Manager@123"}

###
# @name admin
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "admin@bigbite.com", "password": "Admin@123"}

### 4. Customer places a delivery order (two of the first menu item)
# @name order
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "branchId": 1,
  "fulfillmentType": "DELIVERY",
  "deliveryAddress": "12 Flower Road, Colombo 07",
  "items": [{"menuItemId": {{menu.response.body.$[0].menuId}}, "quantity": 2}]
}

### 5a. Declined test card -> 402 with attemptsRemaining
POST {{base}}/api/orders/{{order.response.body.id}}/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}
Idempotency-Key: http-decline-{{$randomInt 1 999999}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"method": "CREDIT_CARD", "card": {"holderName": "Demo", "number": "4000000000000002", "expMonth": 12, "expYear": 2030, "cvc": "123"}}

### 5b. Approved test card -> PAYMENT_VERIFIED, waiting for staff
POST {{base}}/api/orders/{{order.response.body.id}}/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}
Idempotency-Key: http-approve-{{$randomInt 1 999999}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"method": "CREDIT_CARD", "card": {"holderName": "Demo", "number": "4242424242424242", "expMonth": 12, "expYear": 2030, "cvc": "123"}}

### 6. Manager cannot run orders (403 STAFF_REQUIRED)
POST {{base}}/api/orders/{{order.response.body.id}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{manager.response.body.token}}

### 7. Staff accepts, starts preparing
POST {{base}}/api/orders/{{order.response.body.id}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{staff.response.body.token}}

###
PUT {{base}}/api/orders/{{order.response.body.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{staff.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "PREPARING"}

### 8. Staff picks a rider and dispatches
# @name riders
GET {{base}}/api/orders/riders
Authorization: Bearer {{staff.response.body.token}}

###
PUT {{base}}/api/orders/{{order.response.body.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{staff.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "OUT_FOR_DELIVERY", "riderId": {{riders.response.body.$[0].riderId}}}

### 9. Customer tracks the rider
GET {{base}}/api/orders/{{order.response.body.id}}/tracking
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}

### 10. Rider delivers and completes
PUT {{base}}/api/orders/{{order.response.body.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{rider.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "DELIVERED"}

###
PUT {{base}}/api/orders/{{order.response.body.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{rider.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "COMPLETED"}

### 11. Customer reviews the order
POST {{base}}/api/orders/{{order.response.body.id}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"rating": 5, "comment": "Hot and on time"}

### 12. The completed order shows up in the branch sales report
GET {{base}}/api/manager/branch/reports/monthly
Authorization: Bearer {{manager.response.body.token}}

### 13. Franchise report (Super Admin)
GET {{base}}/api/admin/branches/reports/monthly?year=2026&month=10
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

### 14. Deleting a branch that is in use -> 409 BRANCH_IN_USE
DELETE {{base}}/api/admin/branches/1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

### 15. Forgot password -> same answer for any email; read the link in the mock outbox
POST {{base}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "customer@bigbite.lk"}

###
GET {{base}}/api/dev/outbox

### 16. Validation errors use one JSON shape
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register/customer
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "X", "email": "not-an-email", "phoneNumber": "123", "password": "weak"}
